---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---

<Section>
  <section class="about-section cta">
    <h2>Join the Omniverse</h2>
    <p class="cta-intro">
      Omniversify is not a studio—it's a collaborative uprising. We seek raw,
      passionate talent eager to grow while reshaping narratives. No polished
      resumes required—just a hunger to create.
    </p>
    <div class="roles-grid">
      <div class="role-card">
        <span class="role-icon">🎨</span>
        <h3>Artists & 3D Modelers</h3>
        <p>
          Bring Amazigh symbols, Moroccan architecture, and African landscapes
          to life.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="role-card">
        <span class="role-icon">🎵</span>
        <h3>Musicians & Sound Designers</h3>
        <p>
          Fuse Gnawa rhythms, Andalusian melodies, and desert winds into
          haunting soundtracks.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="role-card">
        <span class="role-icon">📜</span>
        <h3>Writers & Historians</h3>
        <p>
          Dive into archives and oral histories to craft stories that resonate
          with truth.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="role-card">
        <span class="role-icon">💻</span>
        <h3>Programmers & Game Devs</h3>
        <p>Build engines for worlds that defy colonial logic.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="role-card">
        <span class="role-icon">🎙️</span>
        <h3>Voice Actors & Narrators</h3>
        <p>
          Speak Tifinagh, Darija, and Arabic in games where language is power.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Section>
